  "reason": "FRAME-PANELS (foundry#2553 L6): the stock shadcn sidebar-15 block (left and right sidebars) adopted as the Studio shell, from its aria-nova anatomy. The left sidebar keeps the N1 sidebar-07 content (lineage.parts) as sidebar-15's offcanvas SidebarLeft; the right sidebar is the chat, sidebar-15's collapsible=none SidebarRight with the stock Empty state (copy unchanged). The header is sidebar-15's: far-left SidebarTrigger and vertical Separator before the breadcrumb, far-right chat toggle after a vertical Separator; both open states persist in cookies. The module column and accordion (frames.module) are removed: each other header icon opens a stock Popover from the page manifest (Esc and outside click close it, ?p= keeps it), each listed in the command menu with its shortcut. Below 768px both sidebars are Sheets.",
